    "body": "Thank you for the files and the example toolpaths, @FlamingFireCoding.\n\nImport check on current `main` (971c23faa, a few merges after v0.24.0), Linux, `camcraft-cli script`:\n\n| File | Result | Time | Facets |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `Rotor.STEP` (3.7 MB, AP214) | imported | 24.5 s | 1,154,050 |\n| `Rotor.STL` (2.5 MB) | imported | 0.1 s | 49,256 |\n\nSo the STEP opens on main, but it is slow and makes a mesh about 23 times denser than your STL (the helical faces are refined finely). That density can make the viewport and the generators slow on a normal PC.\n\nWhat problem did you see when you imported the STEP in v0.24.0: an error message (please paste the text), a long wait, a freeze, or wrong or missing faces? With that we can file the STEP import as its own bug, separate from this feature.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
